+// DESCRIPTION:
+//  Sky rendering. The DOOM sky is a texture map like any
+//  wall, wrapping around. A 1024 columns equal 360 degrees.
+//  The default sky map is 256 columns and repeats 4 times
+//  on a 320 screen?
+//  
