+// The text of the prompt up with the strings of the DEHACKED lump: the
+// Nightmare prompt, and the quit prompt, the quit message of the vanilla
+// one ("%s\n\n" DOSY, m_menu.c M_QuitDOOM) and DOSY. NULL for the others
